# A header-defined factory that emits invalid C must be rejected with a note
# that points at the factory's line in the .cch the user wrote (line 7), proving
# header-harvested factories carry full provenance.
compiled generic factory 'BadBox' produced invalid C for 'BadBox_int'
note: in @comptime factory '__cc_gfac_BadBox'
